WEBVTT

00:05:58.621 --> 00:06:00.163
I thought that no one wanted to know.

00:06:02.579 --> 00:06:06.788
But one person did not buy into my
story of triumph over grief,

00:06:07.996 --> 00:06:11.621
my eighth grade English teacher fixed
me with burning blue eyes

00:06:11.621 --> 00:06:17.288
as she handed out blank notebooks. She
said, Write what you're feeling.

00:06:18.329 --> 00:06:21.996
Tell the truth. Right, like
nobody's reading.

00:06:23.288 --> 00:06:27.829
And just like that, I was invited to show
up authentically to my grief and pain.

00:06:28.663 --> 00:06:33.371
It was a simple act, but nothing
short of a revolution for me.